---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import Photo from '../../public/photo.jpg'
---

<section id="introduction" class="introduction">
  <div class="introduction-photo-container">
    <Image src={Photo} class="introduction-photo" alt="Victorino Lavida" />
  </div>
  <div class="introduction-text">
    <h2>Hi there!</h2>
    <p>
      I'm <strong class="about-me-name">Victorino Lavida</strong>, a backend
      engineer focused on Go, microservices, Kubernetes, and AWS.
    </p>
    <p>
      I build financial systems and enjoy solving performance and reliability
      challenges. At Cicada, I rebuilt a bond-matching engine in Go, reducing
      order processing time from about one second to 200 milliseconds.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
